ed creative writing of a nation, people, group, or culture, such as novels, plays, and poetry.","t":{"ru":"литература, словесность","nl":"literatuur","pl":"literatura","de":"Literatur","fr":"littérature","it":"letteratura","cs":"literatura, písemnictví, slovesnost","tr":"edebiyat, yazın","es":"literatura"}},{"w":"lesson","d":"A period of time in which a person is taught about a subject or how to do something.","t":{"ru":"урок, занятие","nl":"les","pl":"lekcja, zajęcia","de":"Stunde, Unterricht, Lektion, Lehrstunde","fr":"cours, leçon","it":"lezione","cs":"hodina, lekce, vyučovací hodina","tr":"ders","es":"clase, lección"}},{"w":"timetable","d":"A list or chart showing the times at which events, such as classes or transport arrivals and departures, are planned to occur.","t":{"ru":"расписание, график","nl":"dienstregeling, rooster, lesrooster","pl":"rozkład jazdy, plan lekcji, harmonogram, grafik","de":"Fahrplan, Stundenplan, Zeitplan","fr":"emploi du temps, horaire","it":"orario, tabella di marcia","cs":"jízdní řád, rozvrh, harmonogram","tr":"ders programı, zaman çizelgesi, tarife","es":"horario, cronograma"}},{"w":"break","d":"A rest or pause, usually from work or an activity.","t":{"ru":"перерыв, пауза","nl":"pauze, rust","pl":"przerwa","de":"Pause, Unterbrechung","fr":"pause, repos","it":"pausa, sosta, intervallo","cs":"přestávka, pauza","tr":"ara, mola","es":"descanso, pausa, recreo"}},{"w":"recess","d":"A short break from work or study, often for rest or recreation.","t":{"ru":"перемена, перерыв","nl":"pauze, speelkwartier","pl":"przerwa, pauza","de":"Pause, Schulpause","fr":"récréation, récré, pause","it":"ricreazione, pausa","cs":"přestávka, velká přestávka","tr":"teneffüs, mola","es":"recreo, descanso"}},{"w":"homework","d":"Exercises assigned by a teacher to a student which review concepts studied in class.","t":{"ru":"дома́шнее зада́ние, дома́шняя рабо́та, дома́шка","nl":"huiswerk, huistaak","pl":"zadanie domowe, praca domowa","de":"Hausaufgabe","fr":"devoirs, travail à la maison","it":"compiti, compiti a casa","cs":"domácí úkol, úkoly","tr":"ev ödevi, ödev","es":"deberes, tarea"}},{"w":"assignment","d":"A piece of work or a project given to students to be done at home or in class.","t":{"ru":"задание, домашнее задание","nl":"opdracht, huiswerk, taak","pl":"zadanie, praca domowa","de":"Hausaufgabe, Aufgabe, Hausarbeit","fr":"devoir, travail","it":"compito, compito a casa","cs":"úkol, domácí úkol, zadání","tr":"ödev, görev","es":"tarea, deberes, asignación"}},{"w":"essay","d":"A written composition of moderate length, exploring a particular issue or subject.","t":{"ru":"эссе, сочинение, очерк","nl":"essay, opstel","pl":"esej, wypracowanie, rozprawka","de":"Aufsatz, Essay, Abhandlung","fr":"essai, dissertation, rédaction","it":"saggio, tema, ricerca","cs":"esej, pojednání, slohová práce","tr":"deneme, kompozisyon, makale","es":"ensayo, redacción"}},{"w":"exercise","d":"A specific activity or task designed to practice, develop, or test a skill.","t":{"ru":"упражнение, задание","nl":"oefening, opdracht","pl":"ćwiczenie, zadanie","de":"Übung, Aufgabe","fr":"exercice","it":"esercizio","cs":"cvičení, úkol","tr":"alıştırma, egzersiz, temrin","es":"ejercicio"}},{"w":"deadline","d":"A time limit in the form of a date on or before which something must be completed.","t":{"ru":"крайний срок, дедлайн, последний срок","nl":"deadline, uiterste datum, termijn","pl":"deadline, ostateczny termin, termin","de":"Deadline, Abgabetermin, Frist, Stichtag","fr":"date limite, date butoir, échéance, deadline","it":"scadenza, termine, data limite, deadline","cs":"termín, uzávěrka, deadline, poslední termín","tr":"son teslim tarihi, son gün, deadline, mühlet","es":"fecha límite, plazo, plazo límite"}},{"w":"exam","d":"Short for <w>examination</w>; a formal test of a person's knowledge or proficiency in a subject or skill.","t":{"ru":"экзамен","nl":"examen, toets","pl":"egzamin, sprawdzian","de":"Prüfung, Examen","fr":"examen","it":"esame, prova