"tr":"not, puan","es":"nota, calificación, punto"}},{"w":"grade","d":"Performance on a test or other evaluation, expressed by a number, letter, or other symbol; a score.","t":{"ru":"оце́нка, отме́тка, балл","nl":"cijfer, punt","pl":"ocena, stopień","de":"Note, Zensur","fr":"note, résultat","it":"voto","cs":"známka, bodové hodnocení","tr":"not, puan","es":"nota, calificación"}},{"w":"feedback","d":"Critical assessment of a process, activity, or result, often provided to help improve performance.","t":{"ru":"обра́тная связь, о́тзыв, фидбэ́к","nl":"feedback, terugkoppeling","pl":"informacja zwrotna, feedback, opinia zwrotna","de":"Feedback, Rückmeldung","fr":"retours, commentaires, évaluation, réaction","it":"feedback, riscontro, valutazione","cs":"zpětná vazba, odezva, hodnocení","tr":"geri bildirim, dönüt, değerlendirme","es":"retroalimentación, comentarios, feedback, valoración"}},{"w":"learn","d":"To acquire knowledge or skill in a subject or activity through study, experience, or being taught.","t":{"ru":"учиться, изучать, учить","nl":"leren, studeren","pl":"uczyć się, nauczyć się, dowiadywać się","de":"lernen, studieren","fr":"apprendre, étudier","it":"imparare, apprendere, studiare","cs":"učit se, naučit se, studovat","tr":"öğrenmek","es":"aprender, estudiar"}},{"w":"study","d":"To learn about a subject, usually at school or university.","t":{"ru":"изучать, учиться","nl":"studeren, leren","pl":"studiować, uczyć się","de":"studieren, lernen","fr":"étudier, faire des études","it":"studiare, imparare","cs":"studovat, učit se","tr":"okumak, öğrenmek, çalışmak","es":"estudiar, cursar"}},{"w":"teach","d":"To give lessons or instructions to someone; to help someone learn a skill or subject.","t":{"ru":"учить, научить, обучать","nl":"leren, aanleren, onderwijzen","pl":"uczyć, nauczyć","de":"beibringen, lehren, unterrichten","fr":"apprendre, enseigner","it":"insegnare, mostrare","cs":"učit, naučit","tr":"öğretmek, ders vermek","es":"enseñar, instruir"}},{"w":"practise","d":"To repeat an activity or exercise regularly in order to improve or maintain one's skill.","t":{"ru":"тренироваться, упражняться, практиковаться","nl":"oefenen, trainen","pl":"ćwiczyć, trenować, praktykować","de":"üben, trainieren","fr":"s'entraîner, pratiquer, s'exercer","it":"esercitarsi, fare pratica, allenarsi","cs":"cvičit, trénovat, procvičovat","tr":"pratik yapmak, alıştırma yapmak, idman yapmak","es":"practicar, ensayar, entrenar"}},{"w":"read","d":"To look at and understand the meaning of written or printed words or symbols.","t":{"ru":"читать, прочитать","nl":"lezen","pl":"czytać, przeczytać","de":"lesen","fr":"lire","it":"leggere","cs":"číst, přečíst","tr":"okumak","es":"leer"}},{"w":"write","d":"To form letters, words, or symbols on a surface in order to communicate.","t":{"ru":"писать, написать","nl":"schrijven, opschrijven","pl":"pisać, napisać","de":"schreiben, aufschreiben","fr":"écrire, noter","it":"scrivere","cs":"psát, napsat","tr":"yazmak","es":"escribir, anotar, apuntar"}},{"w":"spell","d":"To write or say the letters that form a word or part of a word.","t":{"ru":"писать (правильно), произносить по буквам","nl":"spellen","pl":"literować, przeliterować, pisać","de":"buchstabieren, schreiben","fr":"épeler, écrire","it":"fare lo spelling, scrivere, compitare","cs":"hláskovat, psát","tr":"harf harf söylemek, kodlamak, hecelemek, yazmak","es":"deletrear, escribir"}},{"w":"pronounce","d":"To make the sound of a word or letter with your voice.","t":{"ru":"произносить, выговаривать","nl":"uitspreken","pl":"wymawiać, wymówić","de":"aussprechen, artikulieren","fr":"prononcer, articuler","it":"pronunciare, pronunziare","cs":"vyslovit, vyslovovat","tr":"telâffuz etmek, söylemek","es":"pronunciar"}},{"w":"listen","d":"To use one's ears to hear sound intentionally; to pay attention to a sound.","t":{"ru":"слу́шать, послу́шать","nl":"luisteren","pl":"słuchać, posłuchać","de":"hören, zuhören, lauschen","fr":"écouter","it":"ascoltare","cs":"poslouchat, naslo